  <item>
    <title>职场冲突：你的反应，暴露你的动机和地位</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a7b2bd017676351c5705d6b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a7b2bd017676351c5705d6b</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 14:05:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>为什么60%的职场冲突都是假的？</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>一场会议室冲突，为何暴露了整个团队的隐性权力排序。</span></strong></p><p><span>一场小小的公开冲突，恰恰能暴露每个人在组织里的位置、安全感和隐性权力排序，这也是HR判断团队状态的重要依据。</span></p><p><span>面对冲突，不同行为背后藏着什么样的心理动机？我们怎么判断一场冲突的真实性质？在今天的节目里，主播莎拉将从HR的视角，结合真实职场冲突案例，为我们解读冲突里藏着的职场秘密。</span></p><p></p><p><span>🎙️</span><strong><span> 主播 </span></strong><span>🎙</span></p><p><span>莎拉</span></p><p></p><p><span>🎬</span><strong><span> 时间轴 </span></strong><span>🎥</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="33">00:33</a> 会议室四位同事不同反应，堪称行为艺术展</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="167">02:47</a> 四种反应对应职场冲突、防御、调解、观望四种典型状态</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="226">03:46</a> 拆解行为背后心理动机，梳理四人权力排序</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="295">04:55</a> 隐性权力拥有者A：冲突中微笑旁观毫无压力</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="409">06:49</a> 防御型同事：大脑超载，手机成为逃避工具</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="518">08:38</a> 同事C化身和平使者，主动站出来调解冲突</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="678">11:18</a> 犹豫型职场人：陷入升职冒险还是安稳的经典困境</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="817">13:37</a> 拆解A的安全感来源：过往冲突总能全身而退</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="854">14:14</a> 两类隐性权力者：技术大神或是资源大咖</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="965">16:05</a> C从粘合剂变身调解者，试图提升自身话语权</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1041">17:21</a> 职场冲突的表演性：争资源话语权，别被假生气骗了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1150">19:10</a> 超六成职场冲突根源：权力和责任边界模糊</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> 化解冲突小妙招：先定位冲突层次再处理</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1298">21:38</a> 可调解冲突的背后：公司规则能保护所有人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1349">22:29</a> 偏袒型职场环境：升职加薪全靠老板，无关贡献</span></p><p></p><p><span>📢 </span><strong><span>本期配套福利</span></strong></p><p><span>节目中提到的话术和方法已经整理好了思维导图版本。</span></p><p><span>📌</span><strong><span> 进群方式：</span></strong><span>添加微信 </span><strong><span>salad2014</span></strong><span>，备注【</span><strong><span> 读心术</span></strong><span>】，即可领取。</span></p><p><span>进群后还能享受每周三真实案例拆解、每周五《职场急救包》掉落。</span></p><p></p><p></p><p><span>📻 </span><strong><span>本节目收听方式：</span></strong><span>小宇宙｜</span><a href="https://www.ximalaya.com/album/84358020" data-url="https://www.ximalaya.com/album/84358020"><span>喜马拉雅</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://nj.lizhi.fm/static/newsite/#/manage/voice" data-url="https://nj.lizhi.fm/static/newsite/#/manage/voice"><span>荔枝FM</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://admin.qingting.fm/content/channels/497512" data-url="https://admin.qingting.fm/content/channels/497512"><span>蜻蜓FM</span></a><span> | </span><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/display" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/display"><span>网易云</span></a></p><p><span>📮</span><strong><span> </span></strong><a href="0"><strong><span>投稿邮箱</span></strong><span>：350514403@qq.com</span></a></p><p></p><p><span>💻</span><strong><span> 我们还能提供的深度服务</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><strong><span>人力资源咨询/付费陪跑：</span></strong><span>针对企业或个人的深度项目支持</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span>每月听友群福利</span></strong><span>：开放2个「</span><strong><span>简历优化</span></strong><span>+</span><strong><span>面试辅导</span></strong><span>」VIP体验名额</span></p></li></ul><p><span>详情可以进群咨询。</span></p>]]></description>
