  <item>
    <title>赢了道理，输了局面，职场冲突中如何维护个人权益</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a43cbf69d2f5743684065f5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a43cbf69d2f5743684065f5</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 30 Jun 2026 14:23:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>当别人对我们表达关爱，我们会无所适从，立刻想要回馈对方。</span></p><p><span>当别人冤枉我们，我们遭受委屈，会立刻想要做一些事情证明自己没错。</span></p><p><span>快速反应，往往会做出牺牲自己利益的事情，比如离开一份还可以的工作，离开一段还可以的关系。</span></p><p><span>本期结合心理学「耐受窗」概念，解读职场</span><strong><span>情绪秒回</span></strong><span>的底层逻辑，分享撑大耐受窗的方法，拆解4类职场场景应对策略，帮你在刺激和反应之间找到选择空间，在职场更加从容。</span></p><p><span>🎙️</span><strong><span> 主播 </span></strong><span>🎙</span></p><p><span>莎拉</span></p><p><span>🎬</span><strong><span> 时间轴 </span></strong><span>🎥</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="23">00:23</a> 缺乏耐受力易做出冲动牺牲</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="372">06:12</a> 四种压力默认反应模式：战斗、逃跑、僵住、讨好</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="655">10:55</a> 睡眠不足会让耐受窗缩小30%，更容易触发情绪警报</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="752">12:32</a> 被刺激触发时，三个问题帮你冷静，避免冲动行事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="877">14:37</a> 4秒吸气8秒呼气，悄悄缓解会议压力</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1439">23:59</a> 被误解甩锅，不同耐受窗大小的人应对方式完全不同</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1631">27:11</a> 职场智慧：紧急VS重要，对错VS收益，单次VS长期，关系VS情绪</span></p><p></p><p><span>📢 </span><strong><span>本期配套福利</span></strong></p><p><span>节目中提到的话术和方法已经整理好了思维导图版本。</span></p><p><span>📌</span><strong><span> 进群方式：</span></strong><span>添加微信 </span><strong><span>salad2014</span></strong><span>，备注【</span><strong><span>耐受窗</span></strong><span>】，即可领取。</span></p><p><span>进群后还能享受每周三真实案例拆解、每周五《职场急救包》掉落。</span></p><p></p><p></p><p><span>📻 </span><strong><span>本节目收听方式：</span></strong><span>小宇宙｜</span><a href="https://www.ximalaya.com/album/84358020" data-url="https://www.ximalaya.com/album/84358020"><span>喜马拉雅</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://nj.lizhi.fm/static/newsite/#/manage/voice" data-url="https://nj.lizhi.fm/static/newsite/#/manage/voice"><span>荔枝FM</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://admin.qingting.fm/content/channels/497512" data-url="https://admin.qingting.fm/content/channels/497512"><span>蜻蜓FM</span></a><span> | </span><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/display" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/display"><span>网易云</span></a></p><p><span>📮</span><strong><span> </span></strong><a href="0"><strong><span>投稿邮箱</span></strong><span>：350514403@qq.com</span></a></p><p></p><p><span>💻</span><strong><span> 我们还能提供的深度服务</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><strong><span>人力资源咨询/付费陪跑：</span></strong><span>针对企业或个人的深度项目支持</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span>每月听友群福利</span></strong><span>：开放2个「</span><strong><span>简历优化</span></strong><span>+</span><strong><span>面试辅导</span></strong><span>」VIP体验名额</span></p></li></ul><p><span>详情可以进群咨询。</span></p>]]></description>
