  <item>
    <title>职场&quot;割裂型&quot;领导：对你好，也伤你最深</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a3aa72d9d2f5743683cbb72</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a3aa72d9d2f5743683cbb72</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 23 Jun 2026 15:50:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你有没有遇到过这样的领导——</span></p><p><span>平时挺关怀你的，年终绩效也给你打高分，但某天突然在报销单上卡你、当众让你下不来台、甚至因为一件小事"升堂审问"你。</span></p><p><span>他不一定是坏人，甚至很可能真心提拔过你。但正是这种"对你好，也伤你最深"的割裂感，才最让人内耗。</span></p><p><span>我们不想教你"操纵上司"，只想帮你守住两条线——</span><strong><span>生存底线</span></strong><span>和</span><strong><span>职业生涯底线</span></strong><span>。因为真正困住你的，从来不是坏领导，而是那个"他其实挺好的"的期待。</span></p><p><span>🎙️</span><strong><span> 主播 🎙</span></strong></p><p><span>莎拉、Eva</span></p><p><span>🎬 </span><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong><span> 🎥</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a>小李的培训报销困局</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="270">04:30</a>老常为什么不签字？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="645">10:45</a>小李的盲区：春风得意时的位置校准</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="870">14:30</a>那个的"割裂型"总监的做作行为</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1425">23:45</a>那些浑然天成不自知的割裂型领导</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a>职场人请守住两条底线</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1770">29:30</a>领导的"真心"在那一刻是真的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1935">32:15</a>向上管理实操建议</span></p><p><span>📢 </span><strong><span>本期配套福利</span></strong></p><p><span>节目中提到的话术和方法已经整理好了思维导图版本。</span></p><p><span>📌</span><strong><span> 进群方式：</span></strong><span>添加微信 </span><strong><span>salad2014</span></strong><span>，备注【</span><strong><span>向上管理</span></strong><span>】，即可领取。</span></p><p><span>进群后还能享受每周三真实案例拆解、每周五《职场急救包》掉落。</span></p><p></p><p><span>📻 </span><strong><span>本节目收听方式：</span></strong><span>小宇宙｜</span><a href="https://www.ximalaya.com/album/84358020" data-url="https://www.ximalaya.com/album/84358020"><span>喜马拉雅</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://nj.lizhi.fm/static/newsite/#/manage/voice" data-url="https://nj.lizhi.fm/static/newsite/#/manage/voice"><span>荔枝FM</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://admin.qingting.fm/content/channels/497512" data-url="https://admin.qingti